# Deploy pipeline OIDC trust

Generated by repave when `enable_deploy_pipeline` is true.

## Container registry (GHCR)

The `repave-deploy` workflow uses `permissions.id-token: write` and logs in to
`{{ container_registry }}` with the repository {% raw %}`GITHUB_TOKEN`{% endraw %}.

Enable **Settings → Actions → General → Workflow permissions → Read and write
permissions** when publishing to GHCR.

## Optional AWS ECR

Add an IAM OIDC trust for `token.actions.githubusercontent.com` scoped to this
repository's `main` branch, then configure `docker/login-action` with
`role-to-assume` (see `docs/operations/deploy-pipeline-oidc.md` in the repave
monorepo for a trust-policy example).

## GitOps promotion

After the image push, bump the image tag in the companion Helm chart and promote
the chart version through the `gitops-deployment-generic` repository.
